          "Dataset Imbalance\n========================================\nTraining set:\n  Normal (0): 3430 (98.0%)\n  Anomaly (1): 70 (2.0%)\n\nTest set:\n  Normal (0): 1470\n  Anomaly (1): 30\n\nBaseline (no imbalance handling):\n              precision    recall  f1-score   support\n\n      Normal       0.99      1.00      0.99      1470\n     Anomaly       0.75      0.40      0.52        30\n\n    accuracy                           0.99      1500\n   macro avg       0.87      0.70      0.76      1500\nweighted avg       0.98      0.99      0.98      1500"
